DISCLAIMER

This software rewrites UEFI boot variables and manipulates internal GPU state
at the pre-OS stage. It is provided for research and educational purposes.
Improper use may render a system unbootable or a device temporarily unusable.
Back up your data, keep a second display output available, and make sure you
understand every step before running it. The authors accept no responsibility
for hardware damage or data loss.
